11
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:19,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really wanted to win.</font>

12
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:21,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really wanted a date with Qian Shihan.</font>

13
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:22,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yang gave it his all.</font>

14
00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:24,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really admire guys like that.</font>

15
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:26,080
