31
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:49,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm done being the funny guy.</font>

32
00:00:49,440 --> 00:00:51,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I knocked the blocks over on purpose.</font>

33
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:52,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm interested in you.</font>

34
00:00:52,480 --> 00:00:54,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course I should make the first move.</font>

35
00:00:54,080 --> 00:00:55,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xixi is amazing.</font>

36
00:00:55,480 --> 00:00:57,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She did what I didn't dare to do.</font>

37
00:00:59,080 --> 00:01:00,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I made a pretty crazy decision.</font>

38
00:01:00,680 --> 00:01:01,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I gave them all.</font>

39
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:01,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's real affection.</font>

40
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:02,640
