79
00:02:14,880 --> 00:02:15,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So hot!</font>

80
00:02:16,720 --> 00:02:18,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ke'er, perfect timing.</font>

81
