<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, Feng.</font>

91
00:02:32,040 --> 00:02:32,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not bad, right?</font>

92
00:02:32,920 --> 00:02:33,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's great.</font>

93
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:34,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good.</font>

94
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:37,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Believe me,</font>

95
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:38,560
