101
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:49,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

102
00:02:49,160 --> 00:02:51,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Recognizing Xixi by her voice]</font>

103
00:02:51,480 --> 00:02:53,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me tell you something.</font>

104
00:02:53,400 --> 00:02:55,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't ask anyone out yesterday.</font>

105
00:02:55,440 --> 00:02:57,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to tell them as soon as possible.</font>

106
00:02:57,600 --> 00:02:59,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Clearing up yesterday's choice]
I don't want any misunderstanding.</font>

107
00:02:59,320 --> 00:03:00,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I get it.</font>

108
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:00,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you know</font>

109
