<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't.</font>

111
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:04,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Was it because I called him a show-off?</font>

112
00:03:04,880 --> 00:03:05,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sorry.</font>

113
00:03:05,880 --> 00:03:07,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was joking.</font>

114
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:08,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I meant a cute little show-off.</font>

115
