<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, I...</font>

116
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:10,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At first, I didn't think</font>

117
00:03:10,080 --> 00:03:10,960
