118
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:13,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll find a moment to apologize later.</font>

119
00:03:13,200 --> 00:03:13,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Passing on the apology]
Okay.</font>

120
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:15,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's got a really cool hairstyle today.</font>

121
00:03:15,520 --> 00:03:16,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Fanning the flames]
Let's see how cool it is.</font>

122
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:18,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If he looks really good,</font>

123
00:03:18,160 --> 00:03:19,920
