124
00:03:19,920 --> 00:03:20,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

125
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:21,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Looks win]
Right?</font>

126
00:03:21,280 --> 00:03:22,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What am I, an informant?</font>

127
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:24,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm done passing on secrets.</font>

128
00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:25,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine.</font>

129
00:03:25,040 --> 00:03:25,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't that a good thing?</font>

130
00:03:25,720 --> 00:03:26,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two should talk.</font>

131
00:03:30,320 --> 00:03:31,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gao.</font>

132
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:33,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Send me 200 yuan first.</font>

133
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:33,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Informant turns extortionist]
Send me 200 yuan.</font>

134
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:36,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What I'm about to tell you is worth 200 yuan.</font>

135
00:03:36,120 --> 00:03:37,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Too cool to be extorted]
No. I'm playing it cool today.</font>

136
00:03:37,320 --> 00:03:37,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

137
00:03:37,640 --> 00:03:38,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me record</font>

138
00:03:38,640 --> 00:03:40,320
