I just talked to Annie</font>

140
00:03:42,080 --> 00:03:43,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for almost 20 minutes.</font>

141
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:45,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Know how she feels about you?</font>

142
00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:46,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What?</font>

143
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:47,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[All ears]</font>

144
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:49,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She didn't ask anyone out yesterday.</font>

145
00:03:50,040 --> 00:03:50,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She didn't ask anyone out?</font>

146
00:03:50,920 --> 00:03:51,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[You have to pick someone]
You have to pick someone.</font>

147
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:52,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[She didn't]
She didn't.</font>

148
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:53,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[You can do that?]
You can choose no one?</font>

149
00:03:53,600 --> 00:03:54,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[She didn't]
She didn't.</font>

150
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:55,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[You have to pick]
Surely you have to pick?</font>

151
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:55,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[She didn't]
She didn't.</font>

152
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:56,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And she...</font>

153
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:57,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[A smile creeps in]</font>

154
00:03:57,960 --> 00:03:58,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at that smile.</font>

155
00:03:59,880 --> 00:04:00,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That smile.</font>

156
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:05,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Can't hide it anymore]</font>

157
00:04:05,720 --> 00:04:06,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I feel a little better.</font>

158
00:04:06,640 --> 00:04:07,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A little better.</font>

159
00:04:07,760 --> 00:04:09,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She said today</font>

160
00:04:09,720 --> 00:04:11,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Have a chat]
she's been wanting to talk to you.</font>

161
00:04:12,040 --> 00:04:13,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Magic words: Have a chat]
Have a chat?</font>

162
00:04:13,480 --> 00:04:14,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Have a chat]
It's fine.</font>

163
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:16,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There goes that smile again.</font>

164
00:04:17,440 --> 00:04:18,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I said Gao</font>

165
00:04:18,880 --> 00:04:20,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">had his hair looking really cool today.</font>

166
00:04:20,200 --> 00:04:21,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She said, "If he looks that good,</font>

167
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:23,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">maybe today I should..."</font>

168
00:04:24,320 --> 00:04:26,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Blinded by happiness]</font>

169
00:04:26,840 --> 00:04:27,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

170
00:04:29,320 --> 00:04:30,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I'm playing it cool today.</font>

171
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:31,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[So cool]
You know?</font>

172
00:04:31,360 --> 00:04:32,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I said Gao</font>

173
00:04:32,280 --> 00:04:32,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was really sad yesterday.</font>

174
00:04:32,920 --> 00:04:33,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She said, "What?</font>

175
