<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because I called Gao</font>

176
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:36,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">'a show-off'?"</font>

177
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:37,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She said by "show-off,"</font>

178
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:38,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she just meant you're cute.</font>

179
00:04:38,280 --> 00:04:39,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Cute]</font>

180
00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:40,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Assessing the cuteness]
Maybe girls see show-offs</font>

181
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:42,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">differently from us guys.</font>

182
00:04:42,760 --> 00:04:43,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm already heartbroken.</font>

183
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:47,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're grinning from ear to ear.</font>

184
00:04:48,760 --> 00:04:49,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll see if they're there.</font>

185
00:04:49,880 --> 00:04:50,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I can explain.</font>

186
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:54,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think I should clear things up.</font>

187
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:56,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't want either of them to misunderstand</font>

188
00:04:56,760 --> 00:04:59,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who I did or didn't ask out</font>

189
00:04:59,320 --> 00:05:00,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and think</font>

190
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:02,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sending him a signal.</font>

191
00:05:02,400 --> 00:05:03,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then when voting with Moonstones,</font>

192
00:05:03,880 --> 00:05:05,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he might think, "She likes me,</font>

193
00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:06,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I'll give her a Moonstone too."</font>

194
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:07,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[No mixed signals for Feng and Gao]
Or something like that.</font>

195
00:05:08,840 --> 00:05:09,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yesterday, I really</font>

196
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:11,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">appreciated you both choosing me.</font>

197
00:05:11,200 --> 00:05:12,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I didn't choose anyone yesterday.</font>

198
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:13,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Clearing things up: Yesterday]
I really didn't...</font>

199
00:05:13,840 --> 00:05:14,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[She chose no date]
How do I put it? I didn't choose.</font>

200
00:05:14,840 --> 00:05:15,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Heartbroken.</font>

201
00:05:20,280 --> 00:05:21,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just wanted to say</font>

202
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:23,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there wasn't anyone I really wanted to know.</font>

203
00:05:23,960 --> 00:05:25,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[No one she wanted to know better]
So on the second day,</font>

204
00:05:25,200 --> 00:05:27,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I filled out my departure card seriously.</font>

205
00:05:27,080 --> 00:05:27,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because I really thought</font>

206
00:05:27,880 --> 00:05:29,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">maybe leaving</font>

207
00:05:29,680 --> 00:05:30,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would be better for me.</font>

208
00:05:30,680 --> 00:05:31,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So...</font>

209
00:05:31,840 --> 00:05:33,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's so much fun. Why leave?</font>

210
00:05:33,440 --> 00:05:36,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Clinging on shamelessly]
I'd shamelessly cling on.</font>

211
00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:36,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd even beg everyone</font>

212
00:05:36,880 --> 00:05:37,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to give me one Moonstone each.</font>

213
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:38,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

214
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:39,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's no one I want to get to know either.</font>

215
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:41,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I don't think anyone wants to know me.</font>

216
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:42,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just don't want you to misunderstand</font>

217
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:45,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and think I'm interested in you</font>

218
00:05:45,640 --> 00:05:46,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or something,</font>

219
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:47,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and then, because of that,</font>

220
00:05:47,120 --> 00:05:48,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">choose me</font>

221
00:05:48,560 --> 00:05:49,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or give me Moonstones.</font>

222
00:05:49,960 --> 00:05:51,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine. Whether you picked me or not,</font>

223
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:51,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I gave you a Moonstone anyway.</font>

224
00:05:51,880 --> 00:05:53,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Competing again]</font>

225
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:54,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Fighting for her]
I gave you one too.</font>

226
00:05:54,640 --> 00:05:55,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well, I gave you both one too.</font>

227
00:05:55,720 --> 00:05:56,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

228
00:05:56,200 --> 00:05:56,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Fair and square]
All right.</font>

229
00:06:01,760 --> 00:06:02,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She said she didn't choose anyone.</font>

230
00:06:02,640 --> 00:06:03,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I don't really mind</font>

231
00:06:03,880 --> 00:06:05,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">whether she chose A or B.</font>

232
00:06:05,080 --> 00:06:07,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Liking her is my own choice.</font>

233
00:06:07,240 --> 00:06:08,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Best if she likes me]
Of course, I'd love her to like me.</font>

234
00:06:08,280 --> 00:06:09,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If she doesn't,</font>

235
00:06:09,480 --> 00:06:10,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[It's okay if she doesn't]
that's normal too.</font>

236
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:14,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's not someone who rushes</font>

237
00:06:14,200 --> 00:06:15,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">into feelings or decisions.</font>

238
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:17,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think that's reasonable.</font>

239
00:06:17,040 --> 00:06:18,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We probably need to know each other better.</font>

240
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:20,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[More time to understand each other]
To see how our personalities fit.</font>

241
00:06:20,640 --> 00:06:21,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll leave you to it.</font>

242
00:06:21,840 --> 00:06:22,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go ahead.</font>

243
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:23,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bye.</font>

244
00:06:23,280 --> 00:06:23,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bye.</font>

245
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:24,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bye. Thanks, guys.</font>

246
00:06:25,920 --> 00:06:26,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Want me to take your picture?</font>

247
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:31,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Annie through Gao's lens]</font>

248
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:32,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Both vying for a shot]
Don't go. I want a photo too.</font>

249
00:06:32,400 --> 00:06:33,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hold still.</font>

250
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:34,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[He shoots him shooting her]
One second. I want a photo too.</font>

251
00:06:35,280 --> 00:06:36,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay. You look beautiful today.</font>

252
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:37,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bye.</font>

253
00:06:37,160 --> 00:06:37,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bye.</font>

254
00:06:37,480 --> 00:06:37,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bye.</font>

255
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:40,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's pretty rare</font>

256
00:06:40,200 --> 00:06:40,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for Annie</font>

257
00:06:40,480 --> 00:06:41,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to start a conversation.</font>

258
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:45,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I'm playing it cool today.</font>

259
00:06:45,080 --> 00:06:45,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing can change that.</font>

260
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:47,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Staying in character]</font>

261
00:06:47,960 --> 00:06:48,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Zheng Shoudong, Huang Siyang]
Why did Annie</font>

262
00:06:48,400 --> 00:06:49,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">ask to talk to both of them?</font>

263
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:50,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No idea.</font>

264
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:51,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No idea.</font>

265
00:06:51,160 --> 00:06:52,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think talking to both of them</font>

266
00:06:52,760 --> 00:06:53,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was her way</font>

267
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:55,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of making it less pointed.</font>

268
00:06:55,960 --> 00:06:56,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well, yesterday Ally</font>

269
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:57,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">asked to talk to me alone.</font>

270
00:06:57,560 --> 00:06:58,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Still on his mind]</font>

271
00:06:58,480 --> 00:06:59,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What did you talk about afterward?</font>

272
00:06:59,520 --> 00:07:01,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We had a good chat. Made peace.</font>

273
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:02,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A historic reconciliation.</font>

274
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:06,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then ten minutes after making peace,</font>

275
00:07:06,160 --> 00:07:07,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we started a 24-hour cold war.</font>

276
00:07:07,840 --> 00:07:09,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[First ten minutes]
Can we just forget it happened?</font>

277
00:07:09,720 --> 00:07:10,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

278
00:07:10,680 --> 00:07:11,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's shake on it.</font>

279
00:07:11,200 --> 00:07:12,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[A historic reconciliation]</font>

280
00:07:12,960 --> 00:07:14,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Ten minutes later]
Let's stop talking. Cold shoulder.</font>

281
00:07:14,960 --> 00:07:16,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For at least a day.</font>

282
00:07:16,080 --> 00:07:17,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The cold war begins]</font>

283
00:07:18,320 --> 00:07:19,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why another 24-hour cold war?</font>

284
00:07:20,680 --> 00:07:21,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well,</font>

285
00:07:21,080 --> 00:07:22,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">didn't I tell you yesterday?</font>

286
00:07:22,440 --> 00:07:23,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[No revisiting the painful past]
That whole series of events.</font>

287
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:28,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What did you talk about?</font>

288
00:07:28,680 --> 00:07:31,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">About not choosing each other.</font>

289
00:07:31,440 --> 00:07:32,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's smiling.</font>

290
00:07:32,320 --> 00:07:32,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Smiling again.</font>

291
00:07:32,760 --> 00:07:33,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not that bad.</font>

292
00:07:33,520 --> 00:07:34,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not that bad.</font>

293
00:07:34,440 --> 00:07:36,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My</font>

294
00:07:36,760 --> 00:07:38,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">heart is a little dead inside.</font>

295
00:07:38,440 --> 00:07:39,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wasn't it completely dead yesterday?</font>

296
00:07:39,640 --> 00:07:41,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dead yesterday, a little dead today.</font>

297
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:42,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So it's come back to life a bit.</font>

298
00:07:42,560 --> 00:07:44,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need to stay in this gloomy mood.</font>

299
00:07:44,840 --> 00:07:45,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Gloomy, cool persona]
You know?</font>

300
00:07:45,680 --> 00:07:48,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think it gives me a certain vibe.</font>

301
00:07:48,640 --> 00:07:49,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't tell me any good news.</font>

302
00:07:49,680 --> 00:07:50,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need to stay brokenhearted.</font>

303
00:07:50,520 --> 00:07:51,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Here comes the good news]</font>

304
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:52,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's up?</font>

305
00:07:52,640 --> 00:07:53,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One more thing.</font>

306
00:07:53,360 --> 00:07:55,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wanted to apologize in person.</font>

307
00:07:55,080 --> 00:07:56,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine you called me a show-off.</font>

308
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:57,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think it's cute.</font>

309
00:07:57,400 --> 00:07:59,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Cute]
I call myself a "show-off" too.</font>

310
00:07:59,320 --> 00:08:00,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know?</font>

311
00:08:00,040 --> 00:08:00,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know.</font>

312
00:08:00,960 --> 00:08:02,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Aren't we the show-off duo?</font>

313
00:08:02,840 --> 00:08:03,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

314
00:08:03,880 --> 00:08:04,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

315
00:08:04,480 --> 00:08:05,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine. Don't worry.</font>

316
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:07,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really was just joking, you know?</font>

317
00:08:07,200 --> 00:08:08,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go cry a little longer.</font>

318
00:08:09,600 --> 00:08:10,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's okay. I'm kidding.</font>

319
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:11,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

320
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:12,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Will you team up with us today?</font>

321
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:14,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you want to pick me.</font>

322
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:15,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd pick you.</font>

323
00:08:15,080 --> 00:08:15,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll think about it.</font>

324
00:08:15,840 --> 00:08:16,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Playing it cool]</font>

325
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:17,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I would.</font>

326
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:19,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Not so cool]</font>

327
00:08:19,440 --> 00:08:20,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, I need to stay brokenhearted.</font>

328
00:08:20,520 --> 00:08:21,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to be aloof today.</font>

329
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:23,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Stay in character]</font>

330
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:25,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[In front of Annie]
I want to go have some fun.</font>

331
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:27,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[His cool act never lasts]
The weather's so nice today.</font>

332
00:08:27,080 --> 00:08:28,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Teach me how to make coffee.</font>

333
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:29,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come here.</font>

334
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:31,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Wandering around]</font>

335
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:33,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Sheng.</font>

336
00:08:33,400 --> 00:08:34,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Coming.</font>

337
00:08:34,520 --> 00:08:35,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me tell you something.</font>

338
00:08:36,400 --> 00:08:37,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is important.</font>

339
00:08:37,520 --> 00:08:38,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xixi...</font>

340
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think she really likes you.</font>

341
00:08:39,240 --> 00:08:40,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Love strategist on duty]
She feels</font>

342
00:08:40,560 --> 00:08:41,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she was too forward yesterday.</font>

343
00:08:41,680 --> 00:08:44,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So she's feeling a little embarrassed.</font>

344
00:08:44,920 --> 00:08:45,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xixi</font>

345
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:46,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just told you that?</font>

346
00:08:46,680 --> 00:08:47,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We were getting our makeup done.</font>

347
00:08:47,920 --> 00:08:48,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Afterward, she</font>

348
00:08:49,720 --> 00:08:50,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">said</font>

349
00:08:51,600 --> 00:08:53,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">yesterday felt like a dream.</font>

350
00:08:53,440 --> 00:08:56,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I told her not to worry.</font>

