845
00:25:13,400 --> 00:25:13,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

846
00:25:13,920 --> 00:25:14,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, so...</font>

847
